"Writes one unencrypted Markdown note per meeting, including meetings already recorded, to a folder you choose, such as an Obsidian vault. Each note has the summary, action items as you corrected them, and the people and tracked projects involved. A note you edit, move, or delete is yours: LokalBot leaves it alone." = "為每場會議（包括已錄製的會議）各寫入一份未加密的 Markdown 筆記，存放到你選擇的資料夾，例如 Obsidian 儲存庫。每份筆記包含摘要、經你修正後的行動項，以及相關的人員和追蹤中的專案。你編輯、移動或刪除過的筆記即歸你所有：LokalBot 不會再更動。";
"Writes the Timeline digest to your local journal at the chosen time, then finalizes yesterday after midnight so late activity is included." = "在所選時間將時間軸摘要寫入本機日誌，並在午夜過後完成前一天的日誌，以納入較晚的活動。";
